This licence covers the Voice Me source code only.

The Rhodes samples under src/renderer/sounds/ are NOT covered by it and are not
distributed with the source. They carry their own licence from whoever recorded
them, and that licence governs whether they may be bundled into a build. Check
it before distributing a packaged app — many sample licences permit use in
music while forbidding redistribution inside a sampler, which is exactly what
this app is.

